OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FForeign nationals would lose their
OL,7,Fright to social housing in the UK
OL,8,Funder a Conservative government, the
OL,9,Fparty has said, under plans condemned
OL,10,Fby campaigners as "divisive".
OL,12,FUnder the proposals revealed on
OL,13,FFriday, the Tories said around 230,000
OL,14,Fhomes would become available if they
OL,15,Fremoved the right of foreign nationals
OL,16,Fto live in social housing.
OL,18,FThis move would also see tenants who
OL,19,Fdo not qualify for the housing being
OL,20,Fforced to move out of the homes they
OL,21,Fare in within six months.
OL,26,@rD@SOUrD@\O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
