PN,30802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FForeign nationals with either settled
OL,7,Fstatus, refugee status or specific
OL,8,Fhumanitarian protections currently
OL,9,Fqualify for social housing.
OL,11,FAsylum seekers are not eligible for
OL,12,Fsocial housing, unless in exceptional
OL,13,Fcircumstances such as domestic abuse
OL,14,Fcases.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FCondemning the plans, Sarah Elliott,
OL,7,Fchief executive of housing charity
OL,8,FShelter, said: "These divisive plans
OL,9,Fwould brutally kick people out of
OL,10,Ftheir homes, including thousands of
OL,11,Ffamilies and pensioners who have lived
OL,12,Fin them for decades.
OL,14,F"And let's not forget that social
OL,15,Ftenants pay rent, which goes back to
OL,16,Fthe public purse and into society.
OL,26,@pD@POUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,F"It is completely senseless to ruin
OL,7,Fpeople's lives, drive up homelessness
OL,8,Fand put extreme pressure on councils.
OL,9,FThis policy does nothing to deliver
OL,10,Fnew social homes, which is what we
OL,11,Fdesperately need."
OL,13,FHousing Secretary Angela Rayner has
OL,14,Falso criticised the proposals, calling
OL,15,Fthem "unserious" and "unworkable",
OL,16,Fadding that the plans would not
OL,17,F"tackle the crisis the Tories
OL,18,Fthemselves created".
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FIn a post on social media, Rayner
OL,7,Fsaid: "People without ILR are already
OL,8,Fineligible for social housing, so the
OL,9,FTories are targeting refugees and long-
OL,10,Fterm UK residents who have contributed
OL,11,Fto this country but are not British
OL,12,Fcitizens, including NHS staff.
OL,14,F"It would leave more families at risk
OL,15,Fof homelessness, while driving up the
OL,16,Fuse of temporary accommodation at
OL,17,Ftaxpayers' expense.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,F"This unserious, unworkable proposal,
OL,7,Fcopied from Reform, would do nothing
OL,8,Fto tackle the housing crisis the
OL,9,FTories themselves created."
OL,11,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has
OL,12,Fpromised to take on the issue of
OL,13,Fsocial housing and promised the
OL,14,F"biggest council housebuilding
OL,15,Fprogramme since the post-war period".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
