PN,30807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FThe Royal College of Nursing has also
OL,7,Fcriticised the Conservative's plan,
OL,8,Fwith a spokesperson saying: "The worst
OL,9,Fthing in the world would be to cause
OL,10,Fserious housing worry for a workforce
OL,11,Fthat keeps our services running,
OL,12,Fposing serious risk to patient care.
OL,14,F"Those advocating for them need to
OL,15,Foffer reassurances ` and quickly ` or
OL,16,Fexplain why it is just that some of
OL,17,Four most brilliant nursing staff may
OL,18,Fface housing insecurity."
OL,26,@pD@]OUvD@AOUzD@YO]
