PN,30808
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FUnder the plans, any single person
OL,7,Fcurrently living in social housing who
OL,8,Fis not a UK, Irish or EU citizen would
OL,9,Flose their social home. This includes
OL,10,Fthose with or without children.
OL,12,FAnyone with EU settled status would
OL,13,Fnot be evicted.
OL,15,FFor future tenancies, UK nationals and
OL,16,Fthose with EU settled status would be
OL,17,Feligible, however, any new EU citizens
OL,18,Fwithout settled status would not be.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FCouples, where neither of them is a UK
OL,7,For EU citizen and they do not have EU
OL,8,Fsettled status, will lose their
OL,9,Fentitlement.
OL,11,FThe Tory shadow work and pensions
OL,12,Fsecretary, Helen Whately, said:
OL,13,F"Making Britain your home should be
OL,14,Fearned by working, paying tax and
OL,15,Fintegrating.
OL,17,F"It should not come with a free ride
OL,18,Fon the benefits system. Britain cannot
OL,19,Fbe a cash machine for the world.
OL,26,@uD@AOUyD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
