OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30810
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,F"Labour has lost control of
OL,7,Fimmigration and lost control of the
OL,8,Fwelfare bill, and it is British
OL,9,Ffamilies picking up the bill and
OL,10,Fsitting on waiting lists.
OL,12,F"The next Conservative government will
OL,13,Fmake foreign nationals ineligible for
OL,14,Fsocial housing. Nearly 230,000 homes
OL,15,Fcould go to British families."
