OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FReform UK have accused the party of
OL,7,Fcopying their ideas.
OL,9,FIn a post on X, the party's leader
OL,10,FNigel Farage wrote: "The Tories copy
OL,11,Fevery policy of ours. They are frauds".
OL,13,FHome affairs spokesperson, Zia Yusuf,
OL,14,Fsaid that the new policy is a copy of
OL,15,Fhis party's announcement but will
OL,16,F"still allow tens of thousands of
OL,17,Fforeign nationals" to occupy social
OL,18,Fhousing.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
