CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1786112310
OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FHe said: "Incredibly, Kemi Badenoch's
OL,7,Fnew policy is to STILL allow tens of
OL,8,Fthousands of foreign nationals from
OL,9,Fthe EU to occupy British social
OL,10,Fhousing funded by British taxpayers.
OL,12,F"Kemi's 'CHANGED' Tory Party believes
OL,13,Fif you're Bulgarian, broke, and came
OL,14,Fhere in 2020, you should get a council
OL,15,Fhouse.
OL,17,F"Under Reform, ALL social housing -
OL,18,Fold and new - will be for Brits. Tory
OL,19,F'change' is just a lick of toxic
OL,20,Fpaint. Disgrace."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/13
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
