OL,3,CTory plans to ban foreign nationals'
OL,4,Cfrom social housing branded 'divisive'
OL,6,FIn 2024/25, 88.5% of main householders
OL,7,F` the person in whose name the social
OL,8,Fhome is rented ` were UK or Irish
OL,9,Fnationals and 11.5% were non-UK/Irish
OL,10,Fnationals, according to the English
OL,11,FHousing Survey.
OL,13,FThere are an estimated 470,000 non-UK
OL,14,Fand non-Irish citizens living in
OL,15,Fsocial housing.
OL,17,FFrom Westminster to Washington DC -
OL,18,Four political experts are across all
OL,19,Fthe latest key talking points. Listen
OL,20,Fto the latest episode below...
